    // - For all i < left, a[i] == old(a[num - i])
    // - For all j > right, a[j] == old(a[j])
    // - Elements between left and right not yet processed
    // - left <= right + 1 (loop terminates when left > right)
    // Loop variant: right - left + 1, decreases ensuring termination
